=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ DIFFUTILS @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt GNU diffutils @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt GNU diffutils is free software under the GNU General Public License v3 or later.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [DIFFUTILS.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for GNU diffutils
    At system startup: to define DIFFUTILS$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:DIFFUTILS$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define gdiff, cmp, diff3 and sdiff, add this line to
    LOGIN.COM (add the parameter DIFF to define diff too; it replaces DCL's
    DIFF abbreviation of DIFFERENCES):
    $ @DIFFUTILS$ROOT:[000000]DIFFUTILS$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE DIFFUTILS removes the product and deassigns DIFFUTILS$ROOT.
